galy is an abnormal enlargement of the clitoris, often associated with elevated androgen levels.", "HYPOTHALAMIC PULSE GENERATOR:The hypothalamic pulse generator is a mechanism in the hypothalamus that regulates the release of GnRH in a pulsatile manner, influencing puberty onset.", "FEMALE PATIENT:A 15-year-old female patient referred for consultation due to delayed onset of puberty, with a family history of early puberty.", "PRECOCIOUS PUBERTY:Precocious puberty is the onset of secondary sexual characteristics before the typical age, often seen in females with McCune-Albright syndrome.", "FEMALE:Refers to individuals of the female sex, particularly in the context of the discussed conditions affecting puberty."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}